0Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-04-24T14:23:06Z","updated_at":"2025-04-24T22:23:55Z","closed_at":"2025-04-24T22:23:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105711","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105711","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105711.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105711.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-24T22:23:37Z"},"body":"While working on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105708, I noticed that building with Wayland support and `opengl3=no` would lead to a series of compiler errors:\r\n\r\n```\r\nIn file included from modules/openxr/openxr_platform_inc.h:92,\r\n                 from modules/openxr/openxr_api.cpp:41:\r\nthirdparty/openxr/include/openxr/openxr_platform.h:551:5: error: 'EGLDisplay' does not name a type; did you mean 'Display'?\r\n  551 |     EGLDisplay                     display;\r\n      |     ^~~~~~~~~~\r\n      |     Display\r\nthirdparty/openxr/include/openxr/openxr_platform.h:552:5: error: 'EGLConfig' does not name a type\r\n  552 |     EGLConfig                      config;\r\n      |     ^~~~~~~~~\r\nthirdparty/openxr/include/openxr/openxr_platform.h:553:5: error: 'EGLContext' does not name a type; did you mean 'GContext'?\r\n  553 |     EGLContext                     context;\r\n      |     ^~~~~~~~~~\r\n      |     GContext\r\nIn file included from modules/openxr/extensions/platform/../../openxr_platform_inc.h:92,\r\n                 from modules/openxr/extensions/platform/openxr_vulkan_extension.h:41,\r\n                 from modules/openxr/extensions/platform/openxr_vulkan_extension.cpp:31:\r\nthirdparty/openxr/include/openxr/openxr_platform.h:551:5: error: 'EGLDisplay' does not name a type; did you mean 'Display'?\r\n  551 |     EGLDisplay                     display;\r\n      |     ^~~~~~~~~~\r\n      |     Display\r\nthirdparty/openxr/include/openxr/openxr_platform.h:552:5: error: 'EGLConfig' does not name a type\r\n  552 |     EGLConfig                      config;\r\n      |     ^~~~~~~~~\r\nthirdparty/openxr/include/openxr/openxr_platform.h:553:5: error: 'EGLContext' does not name a type; did you mean 'GContext'?\r\n  553 |     EGLContext                     context;\r\n      |     ^~~~~~~~~~\r\n      |     GContext\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes it for me!","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105711/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105711/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}